title: Proxmox Mail Gateway: Node Status
agents: pmg
catalog: app/pmg
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Basic node health via {/nodes/{node}/status}: system uptime, cluster
 database sync status ({insync}), and the currently running kernel
 release. On a PMG cluster, a node that falls out of sync typically
 means replication between nodes has failed and configuration changes
 on one node won't reach the others.

item:
 None, one service per host.

discovery:
 One service is created if node status is available from the API.
